    "name": "Vindictive Drive 2: Maidbot Archive",
    "steam_appid": 2641420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>VD2: Maidbot Archive</i></strong> is a cross-platform <strong>Mecha-Moe bullet hell Souls-like</strong> with exploration, sandbox freedom, and intense boss hunting \u2014 all wrapped in an anime-inspired, community-driven package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play like a classic twin-stick shooter using your keyboard: WASD to move, mouse to aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/extras/d297dbef3c0e8f821c45223348742c35.avif?t=1755101567\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a newly assigned officer of <strong>Hexcorp</strong>, a crime control organization caught in the middle of a machine invasion led by the <strong>Biokernel</strong>, a <strong>powerful AI</strong> that assimilates everything it touches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You join forces with <strong>Arris Fern</strong>, an ex-terrorist who took revenge on her father 8 years ago, and the responsible for the Biokernel activation, and Hex Reader, an ex mafia boss, both trying to make amends for their past in the middle of a war that is only a small piece of a darker phenomenon, the <strong><i>Vitakrosis effect</i></strong>, where the spirit of revenge threatens to claim the lives of the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In all of this darkness, a positive force rises to the challenge and helps you bring joy and hope to the world, the Maidbots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/extras/f0cb3445ae36ac4ad10688ef343ea633.avif?t=1755101567\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+20 Maidbots</strong> \u2013 From basic shooters to advanced supports, tanks, dashers, AoE specialists, and more. Combine their diverse skill kits with powerful buffs to create your own builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Bosses</strong> \u2013 From early-game challenges to two-phase final bosses. Over 30 enemy types, ranging from simple grunts to highly complex threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Buffs</strong> \u2013 Tailor your playstyle with dozens of build-defining enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 City Districts &amp; 2 Unique Dungeons</strong> \u2013 Each with distinct mechanics, layouts, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloud Saves</strong> \u2013 Play across multiple devices, including the Android version (transfer your save seamlessly).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Maidbots brought to life by professional anime, TV/film, and game voice actors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-Driven Development</strong> \u2013 Vote for your favorite Maidbots and suggest your own designs \u2014 the game evolves with your input.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>The Maidbots have very diverse skill kits, from healers, to tanks, area of effect, dasher and more, you get to combine their skills with several buffs you find in game for a more powerful build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OFFICIAL MANGA: VITAKROSIS, the first Mahou-Shoujo manga made in Uruguay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/extras/2446f78a01dfb7c9db298268153f4401.avif?t=1755101567\" width=800 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>MANGA \u2013 VITAKROSIS</strong>: Read it free online or grab a physical copy (see our website).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Kickstarter Success</strong> \u2013 Thanks to community support, new content is coming: visual and story upgrades, an original song by the voice of Memorimo, official cosplay, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From one developer\u2019s heart to your hands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield awaits. Assemble your squad and make every shot count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>VD2: Maidbot Archive</i></strong> is a cross-platform <strong>Mecha-Moe bullet hell Souls-like</strong> with exploration, sandbox freedom, and intense boss hunting \u2014 all wrapped in an anime-inspired, community-driven package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play like a classic twin-stick shooter using your keyboard: WASD to move, mouse to aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/extras/d297dbef3c0e8f821c45223348742c35.avif?t=1755101567\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a newly assigned officer of <strong>Hexcorp</strong>, a crime control organization caught in the middle of a machine invasion led by the <strong>Biokernel</strong>, a <strong>powerful AI</strong> that assimilates everything it touches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You join forces with <strong>Arris Fern</strong>, an ex-terrorist who took revenge on her father 8 years ago, and the responsible for the Biokernel activation, and Hex Reader, an ex mafia boss, both trying to make amends for their past in the middle of a war that is only a small piece of a darker phenomenon, the <strong><i>Vitakrosis effect</i></strong>, where the spirit of revenge threatens to claim the lives of the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In all of this darkness, a positive force rises to the challenge and helps you bring joy and hope to the world, the Maidbots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/extras/f0cb3445ae36ac4ad10688ef343ea633.avif?t=1755101567\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+20 Maidbots</strong> \u2013 From basic shooters to advanced supports, tanks, dashers, AoE specialists, and more. Combine their diverse skill kits with powerful buffs to create your own builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Bosses</strong> \u2013 From early-game challenges to two-phase final bosses. Over 30 enemy types, ranging from simple grunts to highly complex threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Buffs</strong> \u2013 Tailor your playstyle with dozens of build-defining enhancements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 City Districts &amp; 2 Unique Dungeons</strong> \u2013 Each with distinct mechanics, layouts, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloud Saves</strong> \u2013 Play across multiple devices, including the Android version (transfer your save seamlessly).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Maidbots brought to life by professional anime, TV/film, and game voice actors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-Driven Development</strong> \u2013 Vote for your favorite Maidbots and suggest your own designs \u2014 the game evolves with your input.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>The Maidbots have very diverse skill kits, from healers, to tanks, area of effect, dasher and more, you get to combine their skills with several buffs you find in game for a more powerful build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OFFICIAL MANGA: VITAKROSIS, the first Mahou-Shoujo manga made in Uruguay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641420/extras/2446f78a01dfb7c9db298268153f4401.avif?t=1755101567\" width=800 height=1280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>MANGA \u2013 VITAKROSIS</strong>: Read it free online or grab a physical copy (see our website).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Kickstarter Success</strong> \u2013 Thanks to community support, new content is coming: visual and story upgrades, an original song by the voice of Memorimo, official cosplay, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From one developer\u2019s heart to your hands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield awaits. Assemble your squad and make every shot count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Mecha-Moe bullet hell action meets sandbox exploration and souls-like boss hunting! Experience the thrill of a classic twin-stick shooter, reimagined for keyboard and mouse precision. All Maidbots are fully voiced, bringing every battle to life. Fans call it &quot;The Maidbot Game&quot;.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cTop Steam Games to Look Out for in April 2025 #3(...)an exciting Mecha-Moe style bullet hell game that mixes fast-paced shooting with open-world exploration and tough boss fights, similar to souls-like games. The game is full of action and dodging bullets, and each Maidbot has a unique fighting style.\u201d<br>Games Ardor<br>",
